{"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nCompleted the Cash Register exercise with:\r\n\r\n* Next.js + TypeScript web interface\r\n* Manual input and `.txt` / `.csv` file support\r\n* Change calculation API\r\n* Strategy-based calculation architecture\r\n* Configurable currency/denomination support\r\n* Jest unit and API tests\r\n* Lightweight Go CLI implementation\r\n\r\n## Run\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nnpm install\r\nnpm run dev\r\nnpm test\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe Go CLI is available under `/cli`.\r\n\r\nPlease reach out if you have any questions or would like me to walk through any part of the implementation. Looking forward to hearing your feedback.","created_at":"2026-09-07T22:37:27Z","head_ref":"main","head_repo":"TeflonTrout/CashRegister","html_url":"https://github.com/TrueFit/CashRegister/pull/110","merged_at":null,"number":110,"state":"closed","title":"Cash Register Solution - JT Kazousky"}
