{"body":"To make the output more readable, I output each line that was read from the file and mark whether it will be run through to have change made to sanitize the input then output the change for each valid line from the input file.\n","created_at":"2015-04-20T02:42:14Z","head_ref":"master","head_repo":"uugengiven/CashRegister","html_url":"https://github.com/TrueFit/CashRegister/pull/14","merged_at":null,"number":14,"state":"closed","title":"Code Test"}
