| Check                                     | Result                                                                                                                                                                     |
| ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `npm run check`                           | Passed: formatting, strict backend/frontend TypeScript, production build, 30 Node tests                                                                                    |
| `npm run test:e2e`                        | Passed: 8 Chromium browser tests across desktop and Pixel 7 viewports                                                                                                      |
